10. Let the applicant Irfan Ali S/o Ahmad Ali be released on bail in the aforesaid Case Crime No. 137 of 2022, under sections 376(2)N, 504/506, I.P.C., and section 5L/6, 17, Protection of Children from Sexual Offences (POCSO) Act, 2012, P.S. Katra Bazar, District Gonda, on his furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of Magistrate/Court concerned,
subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
11.

